<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="e9830339">&lt;p&gt;
    The change workstream lead should work closely with each change network when it starts up in order to identify
    appropriate action plans for each impacted business area and develop targeted materials and activities that best fit
    the needs of the specific business function.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="ed1b1fba"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="fddb2034"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="3f9d2c83">&lt;p&gt;
    Define a tailored approach for how each change influencer network can help drive forward the change agenda Focus on
    when and how the members will share information about the change and with whom as well as how they will gather feedback
    about the change, which in turn will help gauge the level of commitment to the change across the organization. Discuss
    strategies on how members can solicit honest feedback from others on the change so that future communications,
    activities and events can be adjusted to actively address any concerns or resistance to the change.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
